{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（22日）中午約12時，大埔富雅花園1座其中一樓層走廊冒煙，驚動多名居民報案。消防派出搜救隊到場，於12時19分停止動員。</p><p>據了解，大廈中層一單位廚房失火，燒毀爐頭及雜物；現場可見，起火單位外牆被熏黑，消防及警方正調查確實起火原因。火警中，約60人自行疏散，幸無傷亡。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，現場可見，一中層單位外牆被熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054121517322240986574.jpeg/3zuiGC-Z4YizAgkvxRwxnbbQqEVIDXlEtGeT1J1nk9Q\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，現場可見，一中層單位外牆被熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多名居民疏散。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054133257703424724039.jpeg/IXJ2uz2VxrpaQOweUfosoB-OjyvfmH7H6TbiksA24pI\"/><figcaption>多名居民疏散。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多名居民疏散。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054130682269696127690.jpeg/e7UEqZDQCrc1XqVv8tdKZt9u-NwOOEbhdETR9F1E0fQ\"/><figcaption>多名居民疏散。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054124264722432650749.jpeg/6UBVTfh7dKMASRstJkaT_3up2MyYR1vXpOcn8Y3nJ_E\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054126852739072025879.jpeg/uoW-GFAJEXv7REKGDNpxt2LEjlqG0mXkTWdbj2RnW48\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054119378227200783614.jpeg/PAQgaHE5vlXynCdJLIX15HSPyyBAg_fp0-wevvrsHr4\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054122188541952274913.jpeg/sHyGWoI5wsiP88IC1DXN2L-U7JunhRykSChQf2EoUH8\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054124805918720432198.jpeg/Zfn6ReYSmKXF6bqbRCvdz9TDeJlBNtwfvvSeIpf0niI\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179054127532347392134690.jpeg/CJt0qXI_5qqr6pLzlqlKhBNNIPWcwAFO154CUf6eAlE\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防員到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，中層一單位外牆被熏黑。（讀者潘太提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179044932325871616678249.jpeg/_xtVFPniVUmHAHvjc4yUIq2ibijgJQDPSK68a0iuvGs\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，中層一單位外牆被熏黑。（讀者潘太提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防到場救援。（讀者潘太提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179044929620414464275198.jpeg/KwLJQHAFIyi_G7L5PPwtqGVrUuz6Bcb_Ckc4LiNHOC4\"/><figcaption>現場為大埔富雅花園1座，消防到場救援。（讀者潘太提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車到場戒備。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179044934599315456205174.jpeg/2pJ3Ed1Of-R0cgJa2Sx2gTMpKYyx5kL9po8ruo-PK7o\"/><figcaption>救護車到場戒備。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T08:09:37.205670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":430,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}